t in Scarsdale, NY</title><link>https://www.eastchesterfish.com/reservations/</link><description>Eastchester Fish Group is a seafood-focused restaurant group known for its fresh fish and daily specials located in Scarsdale, New York.</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 07:09:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Menu | Eastchester Fish Gourmet in Scarsdale, NY</title><link>https://www.eastchesterfish.com/eastchester-fish-gourmet-menu/</link><description>See the menu for Eastchester Fish Gourmet in Scarsdale, NY. Open Monday to Sunday for dine-in!</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 10:51:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Fish Market | Eastchester Fish Group in Scarsdale, NY</title><link>https://www.eastchesterfish.com/fish-market/</link><description>Fish Market The Fish Market is located four doors down from the restaurant at 831 White Plains Road. Convenient parking is available in the lot at the rear of the market with direct access to the store. We personally select our fish from the New Fulton Fish Market and take pride in buying only the top catch available.</description><pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 04:21:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Restaurant Week - Eastchester Fish Group</title><link>https://www.eastchesterfish.com/menu/eastchester-fish-gourmet-early-bird/</link><description>Eastchester Fish Group is a seafood-focused restaurant group known for its fresh fish and daily specials located in Scarsdale, New York.</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 02:33:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Catering To Go | Eastchester Fish Gourmet in Scarsdale, NY</title><link>https://www.eastchesterfish.com/catering-to-go/</link><description>Eastchester Fish Group is a seafood-focused restaurant group known for its fresh fish and daily specials located in Scarsdale, New York.</description><pubDate>Tue, 07 Jul 2026 13:17:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Go Fish | Eastchester Fish Group in Scarsdale, NY</title><link>https://www.eastchesterfish.com/go-fish-location-and-hours/</link><description>Go Fish is open Monday – Saturday from 11:30-6:30 pm. Parking is available in the rear parking lot and on Summerfield Street. Food is cooked to order and can be ordered for pickup online or by calling ahead at 914-725-3450 x5.</description><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 02:28:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Seafood Restaurant Group in Scarsdale, NY - Eastchester Fish</title><link>https://www.eastchesterfish.com/menu/eastchester-fish-gourmet-dinner/</link><description>Eastchester Fish Group is a seafood-focused restaurant group known for its fresh fish and daily specials located in Scarsdale, New York.</description><pubDate>Fri, 03 Jul 2026 02:23:00 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>